Maintainer: Troy Hernandez <troy@cornball.ai>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), r-base-dev, libjansson-dev (>= 2.11)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/cornball-ai/janssonr
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/cornball-ai/janssonr.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/cornball-ai/janssonr

Package: r-cornball-janssonr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, r-base-core, r-api-4.0
Description: strict JSON encode/decode for R via system libjansson
 An R-safe profile of RFC 8259: duplicate-key rejection at any depth,
 NUL and invalid-UTF-8 rejection, exact double round-trip, classed
 error conditions with source coordinates.
 .
 Binary build linked against the system Jansson library: target
 machines need only the libjansson4 runtime, never a compiler or
 libjansson-dev.
